// The `dark` palette the engine used to ship in Rust.
//
// Copy this into your project's `src/` and edit it — that is the point of it
// being a file rather than a name. Every token not listed keeps its baseline
// value, so a theme is as small as the difference you actually want.
theme dark {
    color-background: #0F172A
    color-surface: #1E293B
    color-text: #F1F5F9
    color-text-muted: #94A3B8
    color-border: #334155
}
